From: Christopher Obbard <obbardc@debian.org>
Date: Mon, 6 Apr 2026 02:30:55 +0100
Subject: build: add DISABLE_RUST option to skip building Rust extension

Add a PEP 517 build backend wrapper that checks the DISABLE_RUST
environment variable. When set it delegates to setuptools so that
the package can be built without compiling the Rust extension via
maturin. Also disable the tests which depend on the Rust extension,
if it's not available at runtime.

Forwarded: https://github.com/jtsylve/spice-crypt/pull/2
Signed-off-by: Christopher Obbard <obbardc@debian.org>
